\tag{fdip}
\taxon{Remark}
\title{The finite orbit count}
\date{2026-11-21}

\p{The two orbits of \ref{fdip-0126} have #{72} and #{24} points,
the indices of their stabilizers. The continuous frame orbit of
\ref{fdip-0129} is the set of unit vectors of #{\mathbb C^2}. A
difference of Lie-algebra dimensions is a count for that orbit of
#{SU(2)}.}
